      "title": "Note",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## The list is the node\n\nTick a file, it runs. Tick three, the workflow runs three times.\n\n- **Filter** at the top narrows a long list.\n- Files are grouped by the subfolder they live in.\n- A ticked file that has since been deleted gets a warning marker and is\n  skipped - it does not break the run.\n- **Nothing ticked is a legal state.** The queue succeeds and everything\n  downstream sits it out.\n\nThe four outputs are index-aligned: run 2's `model`, `clip`, `vae` and\n`label` all came out of the same file.\n"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
