      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Note",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Your filenames tell you which model\n\n`label` is wired into `filename_prefix`, so the checkpoint names itself:\n\n    dreamshaper8_00001_.png\n    sdxl-base_00001_.png\n\nUnwire that link and the prefix underneath it (`eps_ckpttest/model`) takes\nover again - everything then lands in one folder instead.\n"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
